{"page":120,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:71","surah":5,"ayah":71,"ar_uthmani":"وَحَسِبُوٓا۟ أَلَّا تَكُونَ فِتْنَةٌ فَعَمُوا۟ وَصَمُّوا۟ ثُمَّ تَابَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِمْ ثُمَّ عَمُوا۟ وَصَمُّوا۟ كَثِيرٌ مِّنْهُمْ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بَصِيرٌۢ بِمَا يَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they thought no harm could come to them and so became blind and deaf [to God]. God turned to them in mercy but many of them again became blind and deaf: God is fully aware of their actions.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَحَسِبُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And they thought","transliteration":"waḥasibū","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَلَّا","en_gloss":"that not","transliteration":"allā","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":3,"ar":"تَكُونَ","en_gloss":"will be (for them)","transliteration":"takūna","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِتْنَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"a trial","transliteration":"fit'natun","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَعَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"so they became blind","transliteration":"faʿamū","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَصَمُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and they became deaf","transliteration":"waṣammū","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":8,"ar":"تَابَ","en_gloss":"turned","transliteration":"tāba","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":10,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"then (again)","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَمُوا۟","en_gloss":"they became blind","transliteration":"ʿamū","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَصَمُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and they became deaf","transliteration":"waṣammū","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَثِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"many","transliteration":"kathīrun","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":17,"ar":"بَصِيرٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīrun","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":18,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":19,"ar":"يَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"they do","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","verse_key":"5:71"},{"pos":20,"ar":"٧١","en_gloss":"(71)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:71"}]},{"verse_key":"5:72","surah":5,"ayah":72,"ar_uthmani":"لَقَدْ كَفَرَ ٱلَّذِينَ قَالُوٓا۟ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ هُوَ ٱلْمَسِيحُ ٱبْنُ مَرْيَمَ ۖ وَقَالَ ٱلْمَسِيحُ يَـٰبَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ ٱعْبُدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ رَبِّى وَرَبَّكُمْ ۖ إِنَّهُۥ مَن يُشْرِكْ بِٱللَّهِ فَقَدْ حَرَّمَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ ٱلْجَنَّةَ وَمَأْوَىٰهُ ٱلنَّارُ ۖ وَمَا لِلظَّـٰلِمِينَ مِنْ أَنصَارٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who say, ‘God is the Messiah, son of Mary,’ have defied God. The Messiah himself said, ‘Children of Israel, worship God, my Lord and your Lord.’ If anyone associates others with God, God will forbid him from the Garden, and Hell will be his home. No one will help such evildoers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"5:72"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَفَرَ","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafara","verse_key":"5:72"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"5:72"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"say","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"5:72"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"5:72"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah ","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"5:72"},{"pos":7,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"He","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"5:72"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْمَسِيحُ","en_gloss":"(is) the Messiah","transliteration":"l-masīḥu","verse_key":"5:72"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱبْنُ","en_gloss":"son","transliteration":"ub'nu","verse_key":"5:72"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَرْيَمَ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Maryam","transliteration":"ma